# launcher-enchants: the saved game the launcher-enchants enhanced session starts from. A new
# character, as the newgame session makes one (every default, the name Avatar); then a test's
# cheats (EXHUME_TEST_CHEATS=1; recording format 6): a crossbow with the weapon enchantment of
# effect 3 (which the game names "of Unsurpassed Accuracy" and DoPlayerWeapon makes 7 damage)
# and a bow with effect 7 ("of Unsurpassed Damage", 7 to hit), as a level stores them (give ITEM
# enchant N), 10 crossbow bolts and 10 arrows, into the pack; and the player moved to (19, 51),
# in the castle's small room south of the door at (19, 53), facing it two squares away (nearer,
# a missile has no room to leave the bow). Saved in slot 1, described "bows"
14000 key esc
16500 key esc
20000 key enter        # Create Character
24000 key enter        # every default: sex, handedness, class, the skills, the portrait,
27000 key enter        # the difficulty
30000 key enter
33000 key enter
36000 key enter
39000 key enter
42000 key enter
45000 key enter
48000 key a            # the name
48200 key v
48400 key a
48600 key t
48800 key a
49000 key r
50000 key enter
53000 key enter        # Yes
60100 cheat give 0x01A enchant 3
60200 cheat give 0x019 enchant 7
60300 cheat give 0x011 10
60400 cheat give 0x012 10
60500 cheat goto 1 19 51
64000 down ctrl        # save: Ctrl+S, slot 1, "bows"
64100 key s
64300 up ctrl
66000 key enter
67500 key b
67700 key o
67900 key w
68100 key s
69000 key enter
